# Trained model artifacts must never have line endings rewritten by git.
# LightGBM's .txt model format is line-based text, which is exactly the kind
# of file `core.autocrlf`/git's own text heuristic is most likely to "helpfully"
# convert -- silently corrupting nothing visible until a byte-for-byte parse
# depends on it. TFLite/Keras/npz are flatbuffer/HDF5/zip binary and would
# normally be auto-detected, but marked explicitly here rather than relying
# on that per-platform heuristic.
**/risk_model_v1.txt -text
*.tflite -text
*.keras -text
*.npz -text
*.npy -text
